iv class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Plague-Doctor-1:W"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Plague-Doctor-1:W/medium.jpg" alt="Plague-Doctor-1:W" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-049">▶原文由此</a></p> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-053 小姑娘</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>Young Girl 2</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">更大龄的版本<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Young-Girl-2"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Young-Girl-2/medium.jpg" alt="Young-Girl-2" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Young Girl 1</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">年龄上稍大了<br /> 少了狂气，多了崩坏<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Young-Girl"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Young-Girl/medium.jpg" alt="Young-Girl" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-053">▶原文由此</a> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-3000 阿难陀舍沙</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>Anantashesha-4</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container alignleft"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Anantashesha-4"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Anantashesha-4/medium.jpg" alt="Anantashesha-4" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Anantashesha-5</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container alignleft"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Anantashesha-5:W+B"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Anantashesha-5:W+B/medium.jpg" alt="Anantashesha-5:W+B" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Anantashesha-1</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>挖出来的旧作</p> <div class="image-container alignleft"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Anantashesha-1:W"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Anantashesha-1:W/medium.jpg" alt="Anantashesha-1:W" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3000">▶原文由此</a></p> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-231 特殊个人需求</strong></span></h2> <p><strong>SCP-231-7,分娩</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/SCP-231-7%2C%E5%88%86%E5%A8%A9"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/SCP-231-7%2C%E5%88%86%E5%A8%A9/medium.jpg" alt="SCP-231-7%2C%E5%88%86%E5%A8%A9" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-231">▶原文由此</a> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-166(旧)</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼Teenage&nbsp;Succubus</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲魅魔少女</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">虽然已经重写了，但还是会画画旧166(<br /> <strong>Teenage Succubus-2</strong><br /> 准备重画(x<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB/medium.jpg" alt="Teenage%20Succubus-2%3AB" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-1003 绦虫婴儿</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼Tapeworm&nbsp;Child</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲绦虫婴儿</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Tapeworm%20Child"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Tapeworm%20Child/medium.jpg" alt="Tapeworm%20Child" class="image" /></a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp--1003">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-4274 孤独天使</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼The&nbsp;Lonely&nbsp;Angel</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲孤独天使</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">我爱这篇文档<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/The-Lonely-Angel"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/The-Lonely-Angel/medium.jpg" alt="The-Lonely-Angel" class="image" /></a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4274">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-354 血池</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼The&nbsp;Red&nbsp;Pool</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲血池</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">它在我心中的地位无可取代，可惜技术有限<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/The%20Red%20Pool"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/The%20Red%20Pool/medium.jpg" alt="The%20Red%20Pool" class="image" /></a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-354">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-1609 椅子的残骸</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼The&nbsp;Remains&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;chair</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲椅子的残骸</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">每次看到这篇文档我就想笑(无恶意)<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/The-Remains-of-a-chair"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/The-Remains-of-a-chair/medium.jpg" alt="The-Remains-of-a-chair" class="image" /></a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1609">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span><strong>SCP-031 爱为何物</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼Whar&nbsp;is&nbsp;Love</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲爱为何物</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container alignleft"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/What-is-Love:W"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/What-is-Love:W/medium.jpg" alt="What-is-Love:W" class="image" /></a></div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-031">▶原文由此</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <h1><span>故事相关</span></h1> <p>随意</p> <h2><span><strong>欢爱之血肉</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼The&nbsp;Flesh&nbsp;That&nbsp;Mates</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">The&nbsp;Flesh&nbsp;That&nbsp;Mates</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/The-Flesh-That-Mates"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/The-Flesh-That-Mates/medium.jpg" alt="The-Flesh-That-Mates" class="image" /></a><br /> 低技术力，应该不会引起不适<br /> <span style="font-size:xx-small;">原本想画男人，但不会</span><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-flesh-that-mates">▶原文由此</a></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>人物相关</span></h1> <p>一言难尽</p> <h2><span><strong>Dr.Clef</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼▼▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲▲▲</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/drclef-member-page">▶人事页</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Alto-Clef:B"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Alto-Clef:B/medium.jpg" alt="Alto-Clef:B" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>Dr.Gears</strong></span></h2> <h1><span>其他</span></h1> <p>一些乱七八糟的、基于SCP世界观的创作</p> <h2><span>杂图</span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼叛教</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲救赎</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content">旧图<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/PJ_JS"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/PJ_JS/medium.jpg" alt="PJ_JS" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h2><span>乱画</span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼SCP-053</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲Parenthood</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/Parenthood"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/Parenthood/medium.jpg" alt="Parenthood" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼SCP-5000</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲行</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/x-art/%E8%A1%8C"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/x-art/%E8%A1%8C/medium.jpg" alt="行" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: transparent">“只希望它们能够比我存在得更久远。”</span><br /> <span style="color: transparent">“祂依旧注视着。”</span></p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xashf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893376&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606764458" alt="XashF" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893376)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xashf" >XashF</a></span></p> 
